    "body": "http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4163\n\nFirefox: about:blank\nChrome: empty string\nEdge: http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4163\n\nNot sure if Edge is using \"the document's address of the responsible document specified by the script's settings object\", or perhaps the document's address of the {relevant,entry,incumbent,current} global object. I guess the current text might be equivalent to incumbent.\n\nI'd be happy converging this to about:blank...\n",
